Package: lemonvox
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: LemonVox contributors <noreply@invalid>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libstdc++6 (>= 13), libgcc-s1 (>= 12), libglib2.0-0t64 (>= 2.80), libadwaita-1-0 (>= 1.5), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.14), libsoup-3.0-0 (>= 3.4), libgstreamer1.0-0 (>= 1.24), libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0 (>= 1.24), gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, pipewire-pulse, gnome-shell (>= 46), gsettings-desktop-schemas
Homepage: https://github.com/itomek/lemonvox
Description: Local-first desktop dictation for Ubuntu GNOME Wayland
 LemonVox records only after an explicit start, sends audio to a separately
 configured Lemonade service, and offers a manual Copy result when safe
 cross-application insertion cannot be established.
